# flip-a (M7): a's flip toggle (296, 412.5, 24 x 24 at 1440 x 900) clicked: a turns −1.00 (a jump),
# the toggle fills with a's colour, its glyph in --background; ↺ comes into the row and Reset all
# into the head. Clicked again (it moved left with ↺: (262, 412.5)), a is 1.00 again.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 308 424
wait 1000
shot flipped
click 274 424
wait 1000
shot back
